# Local Terraform artifacts (the provider lock files ARE committed).
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Real backend settings and local overrides stay on the operator's machine.
**/backend.hcl
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
